Access Database & Dashboard Project

 Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing data stored in a Microsoft Access database and transforming it into useful insights through an interactive dashboard.

 Tools Used

- Microsoft Access
- Excel
- Power Query
- Data Analysis
- Dashboard & Data Visualization

 Project Steps

- Imported and organized data in Microsoft Access.
- Cleaned and prepared the data for analysis.
- Used queries to extract and summarize important information.
- Analyzed the data to identify key performance indicators.
- Created a dashboard to present the results in a clear and simple way.

📊 Dashboard

The dashboard provides a visual overview of the analyzed data and helps users understand the main KPIs, trends, and performance indicators.

 Project Objective

The main objective of this project is to transform raw database data into meaningful information that can support reporting and data-driven decision-making.
